                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bcd52f5e-4cd8-327b-bf3c-6b9d2bb6b2c5",
                                        "entry_id": "93b91ee9-d47a-33e0-897c-769c95385ea6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The side of something, in general senses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68ba20d6-fceb-498d-be90-cf847ebcc7d9",
                                                "sense_id": "bcd52f5e-4cd8-327b-bf3c-6b9d2bb6b2c5",
                                                "text": "Cautiously I approached the flank of the cliffs, where they terminated in an abrupt escarpment as though some all powerful hand had broken off a great section of rock and set it upon the surface of the earth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7af8a1fc-49cb-4067-bd14-9f0db4724110",
                                                "sense_id": "bcd52f5e-4cd8-327b-bf3c-6b9d2bb6b2c5",
                                                "text": "Ahead the flanks of the Pennines gleamed faintly in the moonlight, looking as though they themselves were part of some dry and deserted lunar landscape."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7d6612d-e0df-3d89-b4f4-36fec8a66cdd",
                                        "entry_id": "93b91ee9-d47a-33e0-897c-769c95385ea6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Either of the two pockets located on the seat of a pair of pants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d99370c6-ff53-4ded-96f2-151281c675dd",
                                                "sense_id": "e7d6612d-e0df-3d89-b4f4-36fec8a66cdd",
                                                "text": "I took the quarter I found and hid in my right flank."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ef64771-e6fd-33ea-804c-8ab4882309d3",
                                        "entry_id": "93b91ee9-d47a-33e0-897c-769c95385ea6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An ideological faction within a political party."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "becb1282-964d-4a17-81ed-bac89af97601",
                                                "sense_id": "1ef64771-e6fd-33ea-804c-8ab4882309d3",
                                                "text": "Ford survived a primary challenge in 1976 from the right flank of the Republican Party by Ronald Reagan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8ecaa3a-187d-3895-95b9-56a2bb6dac22",
                                        "entry_id": "93b91ee9-d47a-33e0-897c-769c95385ea6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The outermost strip of a road."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "242f3e9d-f232-3fe7-bb7c-aa02f17d237b",
                                        "entry_id": "93b91ee9-d47a-33e0-897c-769c95385ea6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The wing, one side of the pitch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14a0c90d-1c87-441c-a5fd-80cb952bfb42",
                                                "sense_id": "242f3e9d-f232-3fe7-bb7c-aa02f17d237b",
                                                "text": "The hosts also had Paul Robinson to thank for a string of saves, three of them coming against Jerome Thomas, who gave Michel Salgado a torrid time down the left flank."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a81eacf6-b376-3cab-9c34-ba050d28c058",
